{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「賭王何鴻燊四房兒子」何猷君（Mario）與國際超模奚夢瑤（Ming）婚後育有一子一女，近日在法國補辦世紀婚禮，非常浪漫！何猷君與奚夢瑤非常關心子女教育，近日兒子何廣燊（Ronaldo）幼稚園畢業，何猷君親自出席，並在台上分享童年照片，現場更有周勵淇、古巨基表演，星光熠熠！</p><figure><img alt=\"何猷君和奚夢瑤。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1137043393206030336381642.jpeg/aHZK_XWVmp3PxpL4DClvwReDT81pOlLV0ZlpBNGZaQQ\"/><figcaption>何猷君和奚夢瑤。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"奚夢瑤順長子取名何廣燊（Ronaldo）。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1137040591742308352460358.jpeg/E_2eg2-ZuTlweh2_kHoNqgCvVObHC80wLDBlUywwZVM\"/><figcaption>奚夢瑤順長子取名何廣燊（Ronaldo）。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>何猷君周勵淇古巨基現身幼稚園畢業禮</p><p>近日，有該幼稚園家長在社交網分享畢業典禮片段。片段中何猷君在台上分享童年照，而梁安琪亦有與孫女Romee出席孫仔的畢業禮，一家人非常融洽。畢業典禮排場大，除了何猷君外，周勵淇亦現身台上與小朋友表演，周勵淇一身白色打扮，又靚又有氣質，她與小朋友一起輕輕舞動，模樣十分可愛；而古巨基亦上台唱歌表演，哄到小朋友開開心心，認真識搞氣氛！</p><figure><img alt=\"何猷君出席兒子幼稚園畢業典禮。（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260616/1143608364836720640497503.png/PUTROug4VGnSCYTwM1mGlY_XQy6YzDV5CJ2vdAidr3Q\"/><figcaption>何猷君出席兒子幼稚園畢業典禮。（抖音）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"分享童年照。（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260616/1143608361745387520809451.png/GQZDTvcv5Y3ffSzKMQSBnL1LTdFEuIIxc3bTw3N208M\"/><figcaption>分享童年照。（抖音）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何猷君和梁安琪一家人。（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260616/1143608377591992320632790.png/qZc7JDk900XOgXY4mKclfuCg4_INTBAKAUHOmAFBzpg\"/><figcaption>何猷君和梁安琪一家人。（抖音）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"周勵淇都有出現。（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260616/1143608375461154816076459.png/UJ8M3EzWL1gJ2wuZsuMjFrUXqUMpoB34HOtdCxzrXQs\"/><figcaption>周勵淇都有出現。（抖音）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"靚女！（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260616/1143608373242236928698520.png/g0uKVkGgPp1Cy5XpWgryp8TILxVp7CTmCgNAsgoDQLI\"/><figcaption>靚女！（抖音）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"古巨基表演。（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260616/1143608370943627264960451.png/d7efiX-aEWyP0pEPMP7RfimHeTbKTdVE-LPuN_iz7jc\"/><figcaption>古巨基表演。（抖音）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好識搞氣氛！（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260616/1143608368569520128746813.png/k-M-EyfsTXsn0oCzkSf5d9-d1Dhj-PdjK0KEPitChD4\"/><figcaption>好識搞氣氛！（抖音）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-16T16:18:29.069094+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":453,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}